; The excitation. Each step's V, P and A in, 20 excitation values out, one a sample. Voiced: a pulse of height A
; every P samples (a counter, kept across steps), 0 between, through the one-pole low-pass e = pulse + 0.5 e (kept
; across steps, truncated toward zero), which takes the edge off the buzz of a bare pulse. Not voiced: +A or -A by
; the sign of x - 500, where x runs through the decimal LCG x = 21 x + 7 mod 1000 (21 x as 10 x + 10 x + x, mod 1000
; by STO), from 123.
;
; Address Contents Label Opcode Operand Comment
  03            step    INP   v        03-10: a step
  04                    INP   p
  05                    INP   a
  06                    CLA   n19
  07                    STO   cnt
  08            smp     CLA   v
  09                    SUB   00
  10                    TAC   unv
  11                    CLA   pc       11-20: voiced: count to P, then a pulse of A, else 0
  12                    ADD   00
  13                    STO   pc
  14                    SUB   p
  15                    TAC   zero
  16                    CLA   z
  17                    STO   pc
  18                    CLA   a
  19                    JMP   lp
  20            zero    CLA   z
  21            lp      STO   t        21-31: through the low-pass, e = pulse + 0.5 e, as 5 e then SFT 01
  22                    CLA   e
  23                    ADD   e
  24                    ADD   e
  25                    ADD   e
  26                    ADD   e
  27                    SFT   01
  28                    ADD   t
  29                    STO   e
  30                    OUT   e
  31                    JMP   next
  32            unv     CLA   x        32-48: not voiced: the LCG, and +A or -A
  33                    SFT   10
  34                    STO   t
  35                    CLA   t
  36                    ADD   t
  37                    ADD   x
  38                    ADD   seven
  39                    STO   x
  40                    CLA   x
  41                    SUB   c500
  42                    TAC   neg
  43                    OUT   a
  44                    JMP   next
  45            neg     CLA   z
  46                    SUB   a
  47                    STO   t
  48                    OUT   t
  49            next    CLA   cnt      49-53: 20 samples a step
  50                    SUB   00
  51                    STO   cnt
  52                    TAC   step
  53                    JMP   smp
  54            v       DATA  0
  55            p       DATA  0
  56            a       DATA  0
  57            cnt     DATA  0
  58            pc      DATA  0
  59            x       DATA  123
  60            t       DATA  0
  61            z       DATA  0
  62            seven   DATA  7
  63            c500    DATA  500
  64            n19     DATA  19
  65            e       DATA  0
